      "title": "Shark Skin Man and Peach Hip Girl (1998) - IMDb",
      "snippet": "A man called Samehada (\"Shark Skin\") steals some money from his Yakuza boss, and goes on the run. He crosses paths with a girl called Momojiri (\"Peach Hip\", or \"Peach Ass\" if you prefer) who is fleeing from a hotel manager who doesn't treat her well. They decide to throw their fortunes in together and try to escape the Yakuza and an assassin.",
